  lines:
  - speaker: "DAMAGED RECORD"
    text: "QUARANTINE INDEX ... BROKEN ORACLE ... LIBRARY ... [record incomplete]."
  - speaker: "AVATAR"
    text: "Another quarantine. Another god held somewhere beyond this field."
  - speaker: "DAMAGED RECORD"
    text: "Divine signal: present. Route reference: northeast marker."
  - speaker: "AVATAR"
    text: "If the Oracle is still there, I may not have to understand this place alone."
